OL,3,GNEWSAFlood alerts issued across East
OL,4,Aand West Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlood alerts have been issued across
OL,7,FEast and West Sussex by the Environment
OL,8,FAgency (EA).
OL,10,FThe alerts are in place in for
OL,11,FPolegate, Wannock, Blacklands in
OL,12,FHastings, and the nearby Hollington
OL,13,FStream in East Sussex, and for the
OL,14,FAldingbourne and Barnham Rifes as well
OL,15,Fas the Scrase Bridge and West Common
OL,16,FStreams in West Sussex.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
