OL,3,GNEWSAFlood alerts issued across East
OL,4,Aand West Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn EA flood alert warns people flooding
OL,7,Fis possible and urges them to avoid
OL,8,Ftravelling through flood water, to have
OL,9,Fmedications and insurance documents
OL,10,Fprepared, and to move livestock and
OL,11,Fequipment away from areas that may be
OL,12,Faffected.
OL,14,FThe alerts came during a regional
OL,15,Fyellow thunderstorm warning from the
OL,16,FMet Office, which ended at 08:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
